## Tiers
@z

@x
| Tier  | Usage allocation                 |
| ----- | -------------------------------- |
| Base  | Included with any Docker account |
| Plus  | 2× Base                          |
| Max   | 5× Base                          |
| Ultra | 10× Base                         |
